    "supports": {
      "tts_speed": false,
      "duration_hint": false,
      "tts_emotion": false,
      "word_timestamps": false
    },
    "requires": "自定义节点 DarioFT/ComfyUI-Qwen3-TTS（Base 模型）；上游 qwen-tts 依赖 transformers==4.57.3",
    "notes": "character.voice_id 指向角色参考音频资产；建议 1–10 秒干净人声并提供 ref_text；每次一个说话人"
